// Signing policy for a store build: manual, with the values
// release-build.yml's ios job fills from the distribution profile — the
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY and PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER
// lines appended on the runner, last-wins over the empties here. Fill them
// in by hand for a local `flutter build ipa`.
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY =
PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER =